; sdiff.no — sdiff utility
; Side-by-side merge of two files
; Usage: sdiff [-w WIDTH] [-l] FILE1 FILE2
;   -w WIDTH: column width (default 130)
;   -l: only show left column for identical lines
; Output format: left | right, left <, > right, left (space) right
; 注意：sdiff-pad/sdiff-emit-line/sdiff-run 已移至 diffengine.no
; 原因：这些函数使用 []diff-op struct，跨模块导入会导致 codegen 失败
; 现在通过 # /notools/src/diffengine.sdiff-run 从 diffengine 直接导入
